{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fb0ae1545673c3a336af42a10b706daa.avif?t=1758732689\" data-has-big width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cGhost Deliverer\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300cGhost Deliverer\u300d is a Korean occult fantasy adventure game with top-view pixel graphics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEA (Korean Exorcist Association)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts have threatened peace and safety of us since ancient times. They commit evil deeds in places we can't see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, <strong>KEA</strong>, a secret organization of psychics, protects us from evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.poster.avif?t=1758732689\" width=1300 height=1300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.webm?t=1758732689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.mp4?t=1758732689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hye-seong, A Girl Who Sees Ghosts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hye-seong has a psychic power inherited from her mother, a shaman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She considers it a curse, because accidents happen to her constantly, including her mother's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After meeting <strong>KEA</strong> agents, she realizes that mother's death was related to <strong>'Lunacide'</strong>, an organization of evil exorcists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she be able to thwart their plot and find out the truth about mother's death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/0a024e570603a177118965a320d91918.poster.avif?t=1758732689\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/0a024e570603a177118965a320d91918.webm?t=1758732689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/0a024e570603a177118965a320d91918.mp4?t=1758732689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Lives and the Boundary</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features two places: a real world where people live ordinary lives and a <strong>\u2018Boundary\u2019</strong> created by evil spirits with grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although two worlds are clearly similar, there are differences between them. Also, they are separate but closely connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcise evil spirits hiding in the boundary and threatening the safety of people in order to protect their precious daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/78271f6549d27a6c7973c2f089cda60f.poster.avif?t=1758732689\" width=650 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/78271f6549d27a6c7973c2f089cda60f.webm?t=1758732689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/78271f6549d27a6c7973c2f089cda60f.mp4?t=1758732689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story about the Virtuous and the Vicious, and Life and Death</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Were all evil spirits vicious originally? Absolutely not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were born hoping to be happy, but have turned evil because they were never understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wounds beget wounds, and pain eventually transforms into evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We ask again at the intersection of life and death.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Were they born evil, or pushed to evil?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Boundary, understand the grudges and desires of demons, and help them ascend to heaven by purifying their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1758732689\" data-has-big width=800 height=216 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816720?t=1758732689","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/50494cb77cebb4ea744a5104548ac286f0a63872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758732689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/9836dda13cc5159e1b0a55f326c7e124db160dc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758732689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/9836dda1